From: Md Sadre Alam <quic_mdalam@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: configure IPQ5332 and IPQ5424 QPIC NAND topology

Add device tree nodes for QPIC SPI NAND flash controller support on IPQ5424
SoC.

Add device tree nodes for QPIC SPI NAND flash controller support on IPQ5332
SoC.

Enable QPIC SPI NAND flash controller support on the IPQ5424 RDP466
reference design platform.

Enable QPIC SPI NAND flash controller support on the IPQ5332 reference
design platform.

Remove eMMC support from the IPQ5424 RDP466 board configuration to resolve
GPIO pin conflicts with SPI NAND interface.

Remove eMMC support from the IPQ5332 RDP442 board configuration to align
with the board's default NOR+NAND boot mode design.

Merged from:
  2029-01-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq5424-Add-QPIC-SPI-NAND-controller-.patch
  2029-02-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq5332-Add-QPIC-SPI-NAND-controller-.patch
  2029-03-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq5424-rdp466-Enable-QPIC-SPI-NAND-s.patch
  2029-04-arm64-dts-qcom-pq5332-rdp-common-Enable-QPIC-SPI-NAN.patch
  2029-05-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq5424-rdp466-Remove-eMMC-support.patch
  2029-06-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq5332-rdp442-Remove-eMMC-support.patch

Based on work by:
